@startuml UC-82 Deactivate Teacher Account - Sequence Diagram
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title 2.18.2.6 UC-82 Deactivate Teacher Account — Sequence Diagram

actor Moderator
participant ":UserManagementContent" as UI
participant ":ModeratorController" as CTL
participant ":ModeratorTeacherService" as SVC
participant ":AppUserRepository" as USERS
participant ":ClassRepository" as CLASSES
participant ":RefreshTokenRepository" as TOKENS
database DB

autonumber
Moderator ->> UI : Select "Revoke" on an active teacher account of the assigned subject
activate UI
UI ->> UI : toggleTeacher(item)
UI -->> Moderator : Show the confirmation popup stating that the account becomes Inactive while its content is preserved
Moderator ->> UI : Confirm the operation
UI ->> UI : confirmDisableAccount()
UI ->> CTL : DELETE /api/moderator/teachers/{id}
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : deleteTeacher(id)
activate SVC
SVC ->> USERS : findById(id)
activate USERS
USERS ->> DB : SELECT * FROM app_users WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> USERS : row / none
deactivate DB
USERS -->> SVC : AppUser
deactivate USERS
SVC ->> SVC : accept only an account that is not yet revoked and holds the Teacher role in the moderator subject (BR-18)

alt the account is missing, already revoked, not a teacher or in another subject
  SVC -->> CTL : ResourceNotFoundException / ForbiddenOperationException
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 404 / 403
  UI -->> Moderator : Show the unavailable or not-permitted message and leave the account unchanged
else the account is an active teacher of the moderator subject
  SVC ->> USERS : save(AppUser with status DISABLED)
  activate USERS
  USERS ->> DB : UPDATE app_users SET status = 'DISABLED' WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB -->> USERS : Saved
  deactivate DB
  USERS -->> SVC : AppUser
  deactivate USERS
  SVC ->> CLASSES : archiveActiveByOwnerId(ownerId)
  activate CLASSES
  CLASSES ->> DB : UPDATE classes SET status = 'INACTIVE' WHERE owner_id = ? AND status = 'ACTIVE'
  deactivate CLASSES
  SVC ->> TOKENS : revokeAllByUserId(userId)
  activate TOKENS
  TOKENS ->> DB : UPDATE refresh_tokens SET revoked = true WHERE user_id = ? AND revoked = false
  deactivate TOKENS
  SVC ->> SVC : record the REVOKE_TEACHER entry of the account-management activity log
  SVC -->> CTL : void
  CTL -->> UI : HTTP 204 No Content
  UI -->> Moderator : Show the success message and the refreshed list with the account marked revoked
end
deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
